 ∆Process←{
⍝ If ⍺ is specified it can be an integer. This defines a delay.
     ⍺←0                                      ⍝ The default delay
     rf←⍵                                     ⍝ Ref
⍝ ↓↓ Trapping the VALUE ERROR is needed: it sometimes fails for unkown reasons...
     _←⍺{6:: ⋄ _←⎕DL ⍺ ⋄ _←⎕NQ ⍵ 9955}&rf     ⍝ Make sure that the "Wait" call is ended after ⍺ delay
     0::
     _←rf.Wait                                ⍝ Enqueue
⍝ Events sent to a control won't always get processed without a "Wait" call.
⍝ ⍵ is ref to a control.
⍝ "Wait" is performed on ⍵.
 }
